# Debian trixie (arm64) packages for the rootfs, over the stock harvest.
#
# The harvest's glibc 2.36 and GCC 11 runtime give way to newer ones, which run
# everything built against the old (none of it uses glibc's private symbols),
# and build-gpu.sh builds Mesa in the same release. The Vulkan loader is new.
#
# One package per line: its pool path on snapshot.debian.org (the timestamp is
# BASEOS_DEBIAN_SNAPSHOT in tools/common.sh), its sha256, then the libraries to
# take from its usr/lib/aarch64-linux-gnu into the rootfs's usr/lib (or a path,
# kept as is).

